@EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress = http://localhost:5264

###

### GET all employees
GET {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees

###

### POST - create employee
POST {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Kap",
  "department": "ITHO",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"
}

###

### GET employee by id
GET {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1

###

### GET - nonexistent id
GET {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/999

###

### POST - duplicate id
POST {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Duplicate",
  "department": "CSITIT",
  "salary": 3000,
  "hiredDate": "2024-01-01"
}

###

### POST - malformed JSON
POST {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "Broken",
  "department": "CSIT",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"
  // missing closing brace

###

### POST - missing required field
POST {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "Missing Department",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"
}

###

### POST - invalid data type
POST {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "name": "Invalid Salary",
  "department": "CSIT",
  "salary": "not-a-number",
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"
}

###

### POST - invalid date
POST {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "Invalid Date",
  "department": "CSIT",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "not-a-date"
}

###

### PUT - update existing employee
PUT {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rop",
  "department": "CSITHo",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"
}

###

### PUT - nonexistent id
PUT {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nobody",
  "department": "CSIT",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"
}

###

### PUT - malformed JSON
PUT {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken",
  "department": "CSIT",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"

###

### PUT - missing required field
PUT {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Missing Department",
  "salary": 2000,
  "hiredDate": "2020-10-10"
}

###

### DELETE - existing employee
DELETE {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1

###

### DELETE - nonexistent id
DELETE {{EmployeeDirWeb_HostAddress}}/api/employees/999

###


